# Iso: crash into the trail, turn along it and slide up it 25 away (the closest collision allows),
# with the trail between the camera and the cycle. The cube should stay mostly hidden behind it.
wait 17
press down
wait 0.5
press c 3
wait 2
press right
wait 0.5
press right
wait 0.5
press right
wait 1.5
press z
wait 0.5
press right
